  "details": "This is just a personal issue of mine, but I find it kind of annoying when I join a lobby and it's just full of screaming 15-year-olds who don't follow game rules and just generally make VRChat not fun. Which is disheartening to hear because I enjoy spending time in VRChat talking with people and doing games. My suggestion is that there should be an option to not let 17-and-under users join 18-and-up users, of course, users can lie about their age, but that's what a report button is for.",
